# Mongo instance the test suite targets, so test runs never contend with
# production for connections. Falls back to MONGO_URI if unset. If this is a
# secondary in the same replica set as MONGO_URI's primary, it MUST include
# ?directConnection=true or the driver will auto-discover the replica set and
# route reads back to the primary anyway.
